{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>油麻地有人猝死。今日（20日）凌晨1時許，一名47歲外籍男子在上海街251號對開街頭位置暈倒，朋友見狀報案。救護員接報到場，證實事主當場死亡，事主死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>據了解，事主是尼泊爾裔，持有本港身份證，事前曾經感到不適。</p><figure><img alt=\"油麻地上海街街頭位置有人猝死。（Google街景截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200298871486418944846579.jpeg/-lcrVIHlcuEMtbxclPIJFHNjmblKY7m_uh2yErodshI\"/><figcaption>油麻地上海街街頭位置有人猝死。（Google街景截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T20:23:21.163958+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T20:09:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T22:57:49.966943+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T20:16:50.926976+00:00","content_hash":"751ba0a782cbcd3631eaa33b9efb3f39994d98a270f9e59a9dfcc1f68717cfe6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}